        "en": "The program calls `main()`; a **frame** for the call (local variables, return address) is pushed at the bottom of the stack."
      },
      "durationMs": 2800,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "prog",
          "st0"
        ],
        "edges": []
      },
